    <briefdescription>
<para>Anomaly detector based on population Z-score. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>z(x) = (x − μ) / σ, where μ = sample mean, σ = sample standard deviation. A point is flagged as anomalous when |z(x)| &gt; <ref refid="structthemis_1_1_anomaly_config_1abfd101435d6af34e1f4b3608511f742b" kindref="member">AnomalyConfig::zscore_threshold</ref>.</para>
<para>When σ ≈ 0 (constant series) no anomalies are reported. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
